        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9pzmb9-dxwx6p3k",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "Uyuni: an old steam locomotive in the sand with mountains on the horizon"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_title:359c7c25395d1837",
      "field": "itinerary.title",
      "sourceTextSha256": "5bfe97faa296c3f1fdecb7e43fb7c94f06e98f92b40354742334b50d8cf5afd0",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9pzmb9-dxwx6p3k",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "Thursday: Stone Tree, Termas de Polques, geysers and Laguna Verde"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:5a8704e80dc128a8",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "f7828134e1f3c58847f9eee27b61ab0dae4854b43c2d84324be3c60bd319a840",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9pzmb9-dxwx6p3k",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, set out for the Siloli Desert. Along the way, see the famous Stone Tree. In the Eduardo Avaroa Reserve area, you may spot vicuñas, wild foxes and other animals.\n\nContinue up to the Sol de Mañana geysers at nearly 5,000 m, stopping along the way at Laguna Colorada and the Chalviri Salt Flat.\n\nThe next stop is the Termas de Polques hot springs, where you can take a dip.\n\nAfter lunch, continue to the Salvador Dalí Desert, with its unusually shaped stone columns. The day ends at Laguna Verde and the foot of Licancabur Volcano.\n\nReturn to Colchani and relax at the hotel.\n\n**Meals:** breakfast and lunch."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:72e72a9d32963383",
      "field": "media.alt",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d56bc6695a0ec2997ff30d969717fe29a166a6eb0391bbb2e5e9f00151936523",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9pzmb9-dxwx6p3k",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "Green waters of Laguna Verde at Licancabur Volcano, Bolivia"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_hover:40b382c8a778b885",
      "field": "media.hover",
      "sourceTextSha256": "40183dcb4375edca66537b2649ad70871f4643b5b7eba4d4876f637af076ca6f",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9pzmb9-dxwx6p3k",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "Laguna Verde: a turquoise lake beneath Licancabur’s cone"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_title:6c840bbfa53b5077",
      "field": "itinerary.title",
      "sourceTextSha256": "0cb468281756e39bad47ebcd34b5ea4d4f2e98aaecfc94a4d009634109468773",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9pzmb9-dxwx6p3k",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "Friday: La Paz and Caracas"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:49b18e3fb3f9ec7b",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e6b97e551e2cf324a3becfbf97f688ce72113e1c005b369e39b43c2ab7dc84ab",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9pzmb9-dxwx6p3k",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to the airport and fly to La Paz. Check in for your flight to Caracas.\n\nOn arrival in Caracas, you’ll be met at the airport and taken to the hotel to rest. Then transfer back to the airport and check in for your flight to Moscow."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_label:cb6f13966e23f0c9",
      "field": "itinerary.label",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ee5400eec5b34c56e85dcc8a4d8fd2467e9f49c08efa6bb1ec973ff8a04631fb",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9pzmb9-dxwx6p3k",
